        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Fe fraction, mechanical treatment, CRT screen, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Fe fraction, mechanical treatment, CRT screen, at plant
manual dismantling plus subsequent shredding/separation procedure, based on common transfer coefficients for both steps. Data from literature and from own experiences in Switzerland.;
UUID: eb3d559b-0e09-4732-8d0d-66241cbb54b6
This dataset represents the mechanical treatment of a WEEE devices in Switzerland. Two process steps are included: manual depollution and the mechanical treatment (shredder) of the remaining part.
Location: European data, used as average for global situation
Technology: 4-step-procedure (shredder - separation - shredder - separation) as used currently often in Europe
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature and own experiences 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_eb3d559b-0e09-4732-8d0d-66241cbb54b6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
